OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon school first in England to
OL,4,Awin global prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon's Swiss Cottage School,
OL,7,FDevelopment & Research Centre has
OL,8,Fbecome the first English school to win
OL,9,Fa World's Best School Prize.
OL,11,FThe global awards, founded by T4
OL,12,FEducation in 2022, recognise schools
OL,13,Fthat are "changing lives" both inside
OL,14,Fthe classroom and in society.
OL,16,FThe school, a Special Educational Needs
OL,17,Fand Disabilities (SEND) primary and
OL,18,Fsecondary, was awarded the Community
OL,19,FCollaboration prize for work
OL,20,Finfluencing how communities support
OL,21,Fchildren with complex learning needs.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
