OL,3,GNEWSALondon school first in England to
OL,4,Awin global prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell said it
OL,7,Fwas "a fantastic achievement for Swiss
OL,8,FCottage School and a proud moment for
OL,9,Fits pupils, families, teachers and
OL,10,Fstaff".
